<title>UK: NEWCASTLE UNITED COMPLETE BARNES SIGNING.</title>
<headline>NEWCASTLE UNITED COMPLETE BARNES SIGNING.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league soccer club Newcastle United Plc have signed John Barnes from Liverpool on a two-year contract, the club said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Former England international Barnes, who will be 34 next month, was released by Liverpool on a free transfer after losing his place in the first team.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
